 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0030/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0030</a>|2026/11/18 01:36| 02 | 052| 010| 0455| 0029| 0399| 0476|    \n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/11/17 21:36| 01 | 078| 006| 0165| 0019| 0131| 0182|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/11/17 19:48| 01 | 060| 062| 0470| 0143| 0204| 0801|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/11/17 16:12| 01 | 266| 058| 0452| 0105| 0252| 0624|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/11/17 12:12| 02 | 237| 080| 0297| 0061| 0237| 0492|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/11/17 11:00| 00 | 215| 012| 025"
